ould make Versailles jealous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/8619ba463cf947edd74c9e9f512d8840.poster.avif?t=1739917650\" width=510 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/8619ba463cf947edd74c9e9f512d8840.webm?t=1739917650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/8619ba463cf947edd74c9e9f512d8840.mp4?t=1739917650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/ce8696f1086018923886e8271e5b7e10.poster.avif?t=1739917650\" width=510 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/ce8696f1086018923886e8271e5b7e10.webm?t=1739917650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049410/extras/ce8696f1086018923886e8271e5b7e10.mp4?t=1739917650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Game Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >110 levels of matching madness (because 109 was just not enough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups that make your average garden gnome look boring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate a French garden so fancy, even snails wear berets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay so addictive, you'll forget what the sun looks like (ironic for a gardening game)</p></li></ul>",
